{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["כַּאֲשֶׁר הֵשִׁיחַ עֲלֵיהֶם — this verse is written because it wrote before us וְהַשֶּׁמֶשׁ יָצָא עַל הָאָרֶץ וְלוֹט בָּא צֹעֳרָה. To let us know that the angels waited for him that long on account of Abraham's belovedness."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:44:35.646747002Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}